                  <td>{row.year1}</td>
                  <td>{row.year3}</td>
                  <td>{row.ongoing}</td>
                </tr>
              ))}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <p class="section-body">
          A cellular tracker is cheaper to walk out of the shop with and roughly $150–200
          more expensive by year three. Which is better value depends entirely on
          whether the thing Aorkuler cannot do — alert you — is a thing you need.
        </p>

        <div class="comparison-cta">
